      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹3.03 (down from ₹9.12 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹1.10b (up 7.7% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹24.2m (down 67% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 2.2% (down from 7.1% in FY 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 10% per year but the company’s share price has fallen by 9% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings.",
